    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d442">

                <pb facs="0713" n="609" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg609"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">660P.1111/4</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Latvia (Skinner) to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1314</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Riga</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-04-26">April 26,
                        1933</date>.<lb/>[Received May 11.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In my No. 1307 of April 21, 1933, I
                    replied at some length to the Department’s instruction No. 182 of April 4, 1933,
                    and in my reply mentioned that I was expecting at any moment to receive a note
                    on the subject from the Minister for Foreign Affairs. This note has now been
                    received, and a copy is enclosed herewith.<anchor n="*" xml:id="d442-f1"/> I
                    also enclose a copy of my reply to this note, which I am taking personally to
                    the Minister for Foreign Affairs. I trust that what I have said to the Minister
                    will commend itself to the Department.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert P. Skinner</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d442-a1.xml" xpointer="d442-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d442-a2.xml" xpointer="d442-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d442-f1" n="*" xml:id="d442-f1-content">
